  "body": "This beautiful Browns Bay residence captures the very essence of private coastal family living. Bright, airy and generously proportioned, the home enjoys stunning sea views to the front and an uninterrupted elevated outlook to the rear.\r\n\r\nPositioned on an impressive 804sqm (approx.) freehold section, with a substantial 253sqm (approx.) floor area across three levels, this multigenerational home offers exceptional flexibility for growing and extended families.\r\n\r\nWhat You'll Love About This Home:\r\n•Five bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n•Three generous living areas offering exceptional family flexibility\r\n•Beautiful sea views and uninterrupted elevated outlooks\r\n•Open-plan kitchen, dining and living extending onto an elevated deck\r\n•Beautifully landscaped gardens, a flat rear lawn and established vegetable patches\r\n•Double garaging, workshop and ample storage\r\n•Separate laundry with WC\r\n•Generous off-street parking\r\n\r\nDesigned to bring generations together while allowing everyone their own space, this home truly embraces family living. The seamless flow from the living area to the rear deck creates the perfect setting for summer BBQs, alfresco dining and entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nThe location is just as appealing. Freyberg Park is close by, offering wonderful recreational facilities including sports fields, tennis courts and space for outdoor activities. Adjacent Sherwood Reserve adds another family favourite, with its much-loved playground, walking paths and picnic areas. Whether it's weekend sport, an afternoon outdoors or simply enjoying the green open spaces, there's plenty on offer for all ages.\r\n\r\nSchooling is well covered with zoning for Browns Bay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College, while a leisurely short walk takes you to Browns Bay Beach and the vibrant village, with its cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday amenities. It's the perfect balance of coastal lifestyle, recreation and family convenience.\r\n\r\nAfter more than 45 years in the same ownership, this much loved home is ready for its next chapter with the opportunity to secure a substantial family home in a sought after Browns Bay location.\r\n\r\nContact us to arrange a private viewing or we look forward to meeting you at the open homes.",
